{"unit_id":"tag:023M:proof","translation":"假设我们能证明，存在一个忠实平坦（faithfully flat）的环映射（ring map）<MATH_0001>，使得结论对于环映射（ring map）<MATH_0002>成立。那么，结论对于<MATH_0003>也成立。具体地，对任意<MATH_0004>-模（module）<MATH_0005>，余单纯（cosimplicial）模（module）<MATH_0006>正是余单纯（cosimplicial）模（module）<MATH_0007>。因此，与<MATH_0008>相联系的复形（complex）的上同调（cohomology）的消失（vanishing）蕴含与<MATH_0009>相联系的复形（complex）的上同调（cohomology）的消失（vanishing），这是由<MATH_0010>的忠实（faithful）的平坦性（flatness）得到的。对于扩充复形（complex）的度（degrees）<MATH_0011>和<MATH_0012>中的上同调群（cohomology groups）的消失（vanishing），情形类似（证明省略）。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n但我们确实有这样的忠实（faithful）的平坦（flat）扩张（extension）。具体地，<MATH_0013>可用，因为环映射（ring map）<MATH_0014>有截面（section）<MATH_0015>，并且引理<REF_0001>适用。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"cosimplicial","target_term":"余单纯"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"degrees","target_term":"度"},{"source_term":"cohomology groups","target_term":"上同调群"},{"source_term":"vanishing","target_term":"消失"},{"source_term":"faithful","target_term":"忠实"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"ring map","target_term":"环映射"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context